This is a list of all episodes of the [[Pokémon animated series]], airing since April 1, 1997 in Japan, and since September 7, 1998 in the United States. In {{aniseries|PTS}}, these episodes follow the journey of [[Pokémon Trainer]] [[Ash Ketchum]] across the regions of [[Kanto]], the [[Orange Islands]], [[Johto]], [[Hoenn]], [[Sinnoh]], [[Unova]], [[Kalos]], [[Alola]], and [[Galar]] with his first {{OBP|Pokémon|species}}, a {{AP|Pikachu}}, and {{ashfr|many others}} along the way. In {{aniseries|HZ}}, they instead follow the journey of [[Liko]] and [[Roy]].

The animated series is divided up into eight [[series]], though the episodes are sequential, and so [[EP274|the last original series episode]] is followed by [[AG001|the first ''Pokémon the Series: Ruby and Sapphire'' episode]] and so on. Outside of Japan, it is further subdivided into {{#expr: {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Seasons of the Pokémon animated series}} - 1}} [[season]]s.
